[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24662.43, "timestamp": "06:51:02", "text": "巧克力。所以，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24666.39, "timestamp": "06:51:06", "text": "等待。我当时想，我干脆就吃点东西吧，或者干脆就吃点东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24669.39, "timestamp": "06:51:09", "text": "你可以买到太妃糖或纸杯蛋糕之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24673.03, "timestamp": "06:51:13", "text": "或者任何能帮到我的话，我都愿意提供。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24674.23, "timestamp": "06:51:14", "text": "猜测。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24676.83, "timestamp": "06:51:16", "text": "哦，我们吃巧克力吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24680.868, "timestamp": "06:51:20", "text": "一起。我真的想这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24683.27, "timestamp": "06:51:23", "text": "有很多事要做，但我时间不够。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24686.788, "timestamp": "06:51:26", "text": "好的，米娜。我想写一封信"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24689.03, "timestamp": "06:51:29", "text": "然后和你们一起打开这封信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24690.75, "timestamp": "06:51:30", "text": "读出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24695.35, "timestamp": "06:51:35", "text": "就像我写给你的那封饱含深情的信一样响亮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24699.51, "timestamp": "06:51:39", "text": "男生那种事。但我当时就是我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24701.99, "timestamp": "06:51:41", "text": "晚的。我不得不收拾东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24703.868, "timestamp": "06:51:43", "text": "一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24708.39, "timestamp": "06:51:48", "text": "所以当我吃这块巧克力的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24712.27, "timestamp": "06:51:52", "text": "你会张开嘴说这样吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24715.43, "timestamp": "06:51:55", "text": "问题是，呃，我通常在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24717.59, "timestamp": "06:51:57", "text": "情人节给我买巧克力"}]